    abstract: "Digital collaborative and open access database on Islam and Muslims in Burkina Faso, Benin, Niger, Nigeria, Togo and Côte d'Ivoire, comprising over 12,500 archival documents, press articles, Islamic publications, audio-visual recordings and photographs"
